flowchart LR
  API[Cloud Run API]
  DDB[(DynamoDB Tables)]
  FS[(Firestore Collections)]
  F2D[Firestore-to-DynamoDB Sync Function]
  D2F[DynamoDB-to-Firestore Sync Function]
  Guard{_source marker}

  API -->|primary write| DDB
  API -->|mirror write with _source=dynamodb| FS
  FS -->|document event| F2D
